# API documentation.
#
# The *generated* reference (dartdoc's `doc/api/`, and `doc/api/reference/`) is
# output and stays out of version control. The hand-written
# `api_summary_<module>.md` / `api_reference_<module>.md` files are **not**
# output — `tom_specs_documentation_standard.md` §3.1 and
# `_copilot_guidelines/dart/api_summary_creation.md` both place them here — so
# they are re-included below.
#
# The pattern excludes the directory's *direct children* (`**/doc/api/*`),
# which takes dartdoc's files and every subdirectory (`reference/`, its
# library folders, `static-assets/`) with it. Two forms do not work: git
# cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded, so
# `**/doc/api/` makes the negations below dead; and pub does not honour the
# negations under `**/doc/api/**`, so with that form git tracked the
# summaries while every published archive left them out.
# tom_specs_clitool/test/pub_archive_ignores_test.dart asks pub itself.
**/doc/api/*
!**/doc/api/api_summary_*.md
!**/doc/api/api_reference_*.md

# Symbols
app.*.symbols

